          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/00_Levai-and-loris-02-1240x733.png",
            "media_width": 55,
            "media_position": "start",
            "text_position": "place-self-center text-center",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "Her Creative Space",
            "title": "Nature as a Muse",
            "content": "<p>Armed with her camera and an array of beauty products, she transformed the tranquil surroundings into her personal studio, capturing the essence of nature's beauty in every shot. For Loris, this tree was more than just a backdrop—it was a muse, a source of endless inspiration that fueled her creativity and passion for beauty.<\/p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "background": "#1a1a1a",
            "background_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_gradient": "",
            "button_background": "",
