    "they_met": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "meeting": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/16_Land-for-100000_1.png",
            "media_width": 50,
            "media_position": "start",
            "text_position": "place-self-center text-center",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "Destiny",
            "title": "They Met!",
            "content": "<p>It was a chance encounter, a shared moment of despair, that brought Levai and Loris together for the first time. As they stood beneath the shade of the tree, united in their determination to save it, a bond formed—a bond forged from a shared love for a place that held their hearts captive.<\/p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "background": "#ffffff",
            "background_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#1a1a1a",
            "text_gradient": "",
            "button_background": "",
