        "content": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>As the sun dipped below the horizon and the city around them fell into slumber, Levai and Loris found themselves engrossed in conversation, their shared passion igniting a spark of creativity and determination within them.<\/p>"
