      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "planning": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/2_Loris-under-Oak_-1240x405.png",
            "media_width": 50,
            "media_position": "end",
            "text_position": "place-self-center text-center",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "Taking Action",
            "title": "A Plan to Make",
            "content": "<p>With the dawn of a new day came a plan—a plan to save the tree and preserve the memories and dreams it held for them both. Pooling their resources—Levai's savings from his part-time job and Loris's earnings from her burgeoning beauty blog—they embarked on a journey to reclaim the land and secure the future of the oak tree.<\/p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "background": "#f2f2f2",
            "background_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#1a1a1a",
