      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "triumph": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/10_Levai-loris-1240x875.png",
            "media_width": 50,
            "media_position": "start",
            "text_position": "place-self-center text-center",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "Against All Odds",
            "title": "They Succeeded",
            "content": "<p>It was a risky endeavor, fraught with uncertainty and doubt, but fueled by their unwavering commitment to each other and their shared vision. And so, against all odds, Levai and Loris succeeded. With the deed to the land in hand and the oak tree standing tall and proud, they realized that their journey was far from over—it was just beginning.<\/p>",
            "link_text": "",
