        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "It All Started There!",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "text_color": "",
            "gradient": ""
          }
        },
        "content": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Inspired by their love for each other and their shared passion for beauty and creativity, they embarked on a new adventure—the creation of their own brand. Levai & Loris was more than just a brand; it was a testament to their love story, a celebration of their shared dreams and aspirations.<\/p>"
