            "media_position": "end",
            "text_position": "place-self-center text-center",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "The Brand",
            "title": "Levai & Loris",
            "content": "<p>From their humble beginnings beneath the shade of an oak tree to the bright lights of social media, Levai and Loris captured the hearts and imaginations of countless followers, inspiring them to chase their passions and protect what they hold dear.<\/p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "background": "#1a1a1a",
