        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Diamond & Leaf",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "text_color": "",
            "gradient": ""
          }
        },
        "content": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>With their signature symbols—a diamond for Levai's love of the cosmos and a tree leaf for Loris's connection to nature—they crafted a brand that resonated with authenticity and purpose. Through their fashion, beauty, and lifestyle offerings, Levai & Loris became a beacon of creativity and inspiration in a world hungry for authenticity and meaning.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
