      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Forever Intertwined",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "text_color": "",
            "gradient": ""
          }
        },
        "content": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>And so, as they looked out over the horizon, hand in hand, Levai and Loris knew that their love story was just the beginning—a prologue to a tale of adventure, creativity, and boundless possibility. And as long as the oak tree stood tall and proud, so too would their legacy—forever intertwined with the roots of the earth and the stars above.<\/p><p>And that was the Story of Levai & Loris.<\/p>"
          }
        },
